    "storage": {
      "value": "<h1>Context</h1><p>we want to understand more how our current model with interstitials works</p><h1>Conclusion</h1><p>TBD</p><h1>Research</h1><h2>data</h2><ul><li>dates range:  two weeks 2026-03-01 → 2026-03-14</li><li>platforms: UGT_IOS / UGT_ANDROID</li><li>users: with at least one interstitial view during the research range<ul><li>UGT_IOS: 909483</li><li>UGT_ANDROID: 472255</li></ul></li><li>code<ul><li><a class=\"\" href=\"https://redash.ultimate-guitar.com/queries/25963/source\">https://redash.ultimate-guitar.com/queries/25963/source</a></li></ul></li></ul><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">question</th><th scope=\"col\">research</th><th scope=\"col\">answer</th></tr><tr><td><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3\" data-local-id=\"1cc91617fa37\">How often are local interstitials currently displayed for different segments and platforms?</p></td><td><p>number of splash views before access (from interstitial) by quantile</p><table data-mce-resize=\"false\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" /><col /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><th>platform</th><th>c1, %</th><th>q_50</th><th>q_60</th><th>q_70</th><th>q_80</th><th>q_90</th><th>q_95</th></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>iOS</td><td><br /></td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>Android</td><td><br /></td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">5</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">7</td></tr></tbody></table></td><td><p>maximum interstitials per users per 14 days</p><ul><li>iOS – 66</li><li>Android – 73</li></ul><p>this is an anomaly and it should be fixed</p><p><br /></p><p>maximum number of interstitials per user per 14 days before purchasing from the interstitial</p><ul><li>iOS – 22</li><li>Android – 42</li></ul><p><br /></p><p>60% of users who purchase from the splash, do it from the first interstitial</p><p>90% of users purchase from the second interstitial on iOS and fifth on Android</p><p><br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"98\" data-local-id=\"8db7380fa582\">Which display frequency converts free and paid segments (purchase, trial, intro) most often?</p></td><td> <p>number of splash views before access (from interstitial) by quantile</p><table data-mce-resize=\"false\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" /><col /><col /><col /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /><col class=\"\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><th>platform</th><th>interstitial</th><th>pro rights</th><th>c1, %</th><th>q_50</th><th>q_60</th><th>q_70</th><th>q_80</th><th>q_90</th><th>q_95</th></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"3\">iOS</td><td>AD 14Free Interstitial</td><td>0</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">0.16%</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">4</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">AD Winback Interstitial</td><td>4</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2.44%</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>5</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1.18%</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"10\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\">Android</td><td>AD 14Free Interstitial</td><td>0</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">0.11%</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">6</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">8</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">AD Winback Interstitial</td><td>4</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">3.87%</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">4</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">7</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2.04%</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">5</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">6</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p></td><td> <ul><li>iOS<ul><li><strong>AD 14Free Interstitial</strong><br /><ul><li>maximum number of interstitials per user per 14 days before purchasing from the interstitial – <strong>18</strong></li><li><strong>70%</strong> of users who purchase from the splash, do it from the <strong>first</strong> interstitial</li><li><strong>90%</strong> of users purchase from the <strong>3</strong> interstitial</li></ul></li><li><strong>AD Winback Interstitial</strong><br /><ul><li>maximum number of interstitials per user per 14 days before purchasing from the interstitial – <strong>22</strong> for ex trials and <strong>12</strong> for ex paid subscribers</li><li><strong>70%</strong> of users who purchase from the splash, do it from the <strong>first</strong> interstitial</li><li><strong>90%</strong> of users purchase